@page "/"

<PageTitle>MedEase Dashboard</PageTitle>

<div class="text-center mb-5">
    <h1 class="display-4 text-primary">Welcome to MedEase</h1>
    <p class="lead">Smart Appointment & Patient Record System</p>
    <hr class="my-4">
    <p>Select a module below to access specific clinic functions.</p>
</div>

<div class="row">
    <div class="col-md-4 mb-4">
        <div class="card h-100 shadow-sm border-primary">
            <div class="card-header bg-primary text-white">
                <i class="bi bi-calendar-check"></i> Patient Services
            </div>
            <div class="card-body">
                <h5 class="card-title">Book Appointment</h5>
                <p class="card-text">Schedule new consultations efficiently.</p>
                <ul class="small text-muted">
                    <li>Creates Appointments (<strong>Factory</strong>)</li>
                    <li>Saves to DB (<strong>Singleton</strong>)</li>
                    <li>Sends Email Alerts (<strong>Observer</strong>)</li>
                </ul>
            </div>
            <div class="card-footer bg-transparent border-top-0">
                <a href="book-appointment" class="btn btn-primary w-100">Go to Booking</a>
            </div>
        </div>
    </div>

    <div class="col-md-4 mb-4">
        <div class="card h-100 shadow-sm border-success">
            <div class="card-header bg-success text-white">
                <i class="bi bi-folder2-open"></i> Medical Records
            </div>
            <div class="card-body">
                <h5 class="card-title">Patient History</h5>
                <p class="card-text">View and manage hierarchical patient files.</p>
                <ul class="small text-muted">
                    <li>Recursive Folder Structure</li>
                    <li>Treats Files & Folders Uniformly</li>
                    <li>Pattern: <strong>Composite</strong></li>
                </ul>
            </div>
            <div class="card-footer bg-transparent border-top-0">
                <a href="patient-records" class="btn btn-success w-100">View Records</a>
            </div>
        </div>
    </div>

    <div class="col-md-4 mb-4">
        <div class="card h-100 shadow-sm border-info">
            <div class="card-header bg-info text-white">
                <i class="bi bi-bar-chart-line"></i> Doctor's Portal
            </div>
            <div class="card-body">
                <h5 class="card-title">Reports & Analytics</h5>
                <p class="card-text">Generate daily operational reports.</p>
                <ul class="small text-muted">
                    <li>Export to PDF or CSV</li>
                    <li>Swaps Algorithms at Runtime</li>
                    <li>Pattern: <strong>Strategy</strong></li>
                </ul>
            </div>
            <div class="card-footer bg-transparent border-top-0">
                <a href="doctor-dashboard" class="btn btn-info w-100 text-white">Generate Reports</a>
            </div>
        </div>
    </div>
</div>

<div class="alert alert-secondary mt-5" role="alert">
    <h4 class="alert-heading">Technical Overview</h4>
    <p>This system demonstrates the following Software Design Patterns:</p>
    <hr>
    <div class="row">
        <div class="col-sm-6">
            <strong>1. Singleton:</strong> Database Connection Manager<br>
            <strong>2. Factory:</strong> Appointment Object Creation
        </div>
        <div class="col-sm-6">
            <strong>3. Observer:</strong> Notification System<br>
            <strong>4. Composite:</strong> Patient Record Hierarchy<br>
            <strong>5. Strategy:</strong> Report Export Formats
        </div>
    </div>
</div>